data: {"delta":"Based on the retrieved evidence, here's what I can tell you about the movie \"Scene\":\n\nThe movie \"Scene\" is scheduled to be released on November 6, 2026 in multiple countries including Ireland, India, and the United States [1]. It's an upcoming Indian Tamil-language action comedy film [3].\n\nThe hero of the movie is Suriya (also referred to as Suriya Sivakumar) [2, 4, 6]. The cast also includes Nazriya Nazim, Naslen, Anandraj, and Lal [4].\n\nI don't have information about who plays the villain in the movie from the retrieved sources.","conversationId":"cmvymbos6003urmvn92m7b5dt"}

